#Attitudes towards immigration approaches 
```{r}
#Allow many/few immigrants of same race/ethnic group as majority
#1 = allow many, 2= some, 3 = few, 4 = none
#0 = allow none, 1 = allow few, 2 = allow some, 3 = allow many
ess_raw$impol1 = ifelse(ess_raw$imsmetn == 1, 3,
                         ifelse(ess_raw$imsmetn == 2, 2,
                         ifelse(ess_raw$imsmetn == 3, 1, 0)))

#Allow many/few immigrants of different race/ethnic group from majority
#1 = allow many, 2= some, 3 = few, 4 = none
ess_raw = ess_raw[!(ess_raw$imdfetn >4), ]
#0 = allow none, 1 = allow few, 2 = allow some, 3 = allow many
ess_raw$impol2 = ifelse(ess_raw$imdfetn == 1, 3,
                         ifelse(ess_raw$imdfetn == 2, 2,
                         ifelse(ess_raw$imdfetn == 3, 1, 0)))

#Allow many/few immigrants from poorer countries outside Europe
#1 = allow many, 2= some, 3 = few, 4 = none
ess_raw = ess_raw[!(ess_raw$impcntr >4), ]
#0 = allow none, 1 = allow few, 2 = allow some, 3 = allow many
ess_raw$impol3 = ifelse(ess_raw$impcntr == 1, 3,
                         ifelse(ess_raw$impcntr == 2, 2,
                         ifelse(ess_raw$impcntr == 3, 1, 0)))
```

